---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Mitchell Haw | SEO & AI Search Consultant in Bend, Oregon"
  description="SEO, AI search, local SEO, content strategy, and digital visibility consulting for businesses in Bend and Central Oregon."
  image="/images/smith-rock-central-oregon.jpg"
>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@graph": [
        {
          "@type": "Person",
          "@id": "https://mitchellhaw.com/#person",
          "name": "Mitchell Haw",
          "url": "https://mitchellhaw.com/",
          "jobTitle": "SEO & AI Search Consultant",
          "image": "https://mitchellhaw.com/images/mitchell-haw.jpg",
          "sameAs": [
            "https://www.linkedin.com/in/mitchellhaw"
          ],
          "address": {
            "@type": "PostalAddress",
            "addressLocality": "Bend",
            "addressRegion": "OR",
            "addressCountry": "US"
          },
          "description": "Bend-based digital strategist specializing in SEO, AI search, local visibility, content strategy, and organic growth."
        },
        {
          "@type": "WebSite",
          "@id": "https://mitchellhaw.com/#website",
          "url": "https://mitchellhaw.com/",
          "name": "Mitchell Haw",
          "publisher": {
            "@id": "https://mitchellhaw.com/#person"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  </script>

  <main class="home-main">
    <section class="home-hero">
      <div class="container home-hero-grid">
        <div class="home-hero-copy">
          <p class="home-kicker">SEO & AI Search Consultant · Bend, Oregon</p>
          <h1>Get found in Bend. And everywhere people search.</h1>
          <p class="home-hero-text">
            I help businesses improve visibility across Google, AI search, maps, content, and local discovery—with practical strategy built around what will actually move the needle.
          </p>

          <div class="home-hero-actions">
            <a class="home-btn home-btn-primary" href="/contact/">Get a Visibility Review</a>
            <a class="home-btn home-btn-secondary" href="#services">Explore Services</a>
          </div>

          <div class="home-trust-line" aria-label="Business focus">
            <span>Bend-based</span>
            <span>Central Oregon</span>
            <span>National brand experience</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="home-hero-visual">
          <img
            src="/images/smith-rock-central-oregon.jpg"
            alt="Smith Rock in Central Oregon"
          />
          <div class="home-visual-caption">
            <span>Based in Bend, Oregon</span>
            <strong>Local perspective. Modern search strategy.</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-intro">
      <div class="container home-intro-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="home-section-kicker">Modern search strategy</p>
          <h2>Search changed. The goal didn’t.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="home-intro-copy">
          <p class="home-intro-lead">Your business still needs to be easy to find, understand, and trust.</p>
          <p>
            The difference is that discovery now happens across Google Search, Google Maps, ChatGPT, AI Overviews, YouTube, reviews, local listings, and the content those platforms rely on. I help connect those pieces into one clear strategy.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-services" id="services">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="home-section-heading">
          <div>
            <p class="home-section-kicker">Services</p>
            <h2>What I can help with.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>
            Strategy and hands-on support for businesses that want stronger organic visibility without turning search into a pile of disconnected tactics.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="home-service-grid">
          <a class="home-service-card" href="/services/seo/">
            <span class="service-number">01</span>
            <h3>SEO Strategy</h3>
            <p>Technical SEO, site architecture, migrations, keyword strategy, internal linking, content planning, and organic growth.</p>
            <span class="service-link">Explore SEO →</span>
          </a>

          <a class="home-service-card" href="/services/ai-search/">
            <span class="service-number">02</span>
            <h3>AI Search Visibility</h3>
            <p>Improve how your brand is understood and surfaced across ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews, and answer engines.</p>
            <span class="service-link">Explore AI Search →</span>
          </a>

          <a class="home-service-card" href="/services/seo-bend-oregon/">
            <span class="service-number">03</span>
            <h3>Local SEO</h3>
            <p>Google Business Profile, maps visibility, reviews, local landing pages, listings, and stronger local discovery across Central Oregon.</p>
            <span class="service-link">Explore Local SEO →</span>
          </a>

          <a class="home-service-card" href="/services/video-marketing/">
            <span class="service-number">04</span>
            <h3>Content & Video</h3>
            <p>Useful content, search intent coverage, video discovery, and content systems built around the questions customers actually ask.</p>
            <span class="service-link">Explore Content & Video →</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-local">
      <div class="container home-local-grid">
        <div class="home-local-copy">
          <p class="home-section-kicker">Central Oregon SEO</p>
          <h2>Local search matters more when you actually know the market.</h2>
          <p>
            I’m based in Bend and work with businesses across Central Oregon. That means local SEO is not treated like a generic location-page exercise—it is built around how people here actually search, compare, visit, and buy.
          </p>
          <a class="home-text-link" href="/services/seo-bend-oregon/">Local SEO in Bend →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="home-location-list">
          <a href="/services/seo-bend-oregon/">
            <span>Bend</span><strong>SEO & local visibility</strong><b>→</b>
          </a>
          <a href="/services/seo-redmond-oregon/">
            <span>Redmond</span><strong>SEO & local visibility</strong><b>→</b>
          </a>
          <a href="/services/seo-sisters-oregon/">
            <span>Sisters</span><strong>SEO & local visibility</strong><b>→</b>
          </a>
          <a href="/services/seo-sunriver-oregon/">
            <span>Sunriver</span><strong>SEO & local visibility</strong><b>→</b>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-about">
      <div class="container home-about-grid">
        <div class="home-about-media">
          <img
            src="/images/mitchell-haw.jpg"
            alt="Mitchell Haw, SEO and AI search consultant in Bend, Oregon"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="home-about-copy">
          <p class="home-section-kicker">About Mitchell</p>
          <h2>Local perspective. National-level experience.</h2>
          <p class="home-about-lead">
            I’m Mitchell Haw, a Bend-based digital strategist focused on SEO, AI search, local visibility, content strategy, analytics, and organic growth.
          </p>
          <p>
            My work spans large national websites, complex migrations, multi-location search programs, local businesses, and my own web projects. I bring the same approach to all of them: understand the problem, prioritize what matters, and make the work useful enough to act on.
          </p>

          <div class="home-proof-grid">
            <div><strong>SEO</strong><span>Technical + content</span></div>
            <div><strong>AI Search</strong><span>Visibility + measurement</span></div>
            <div><strong>Local</strong><span>Maps + discovery</span></div>
            <div><strong>Analytics</strong><span>GA4 + Search Console</span></div>
          </div>

          <a class="home-text-link" href="/about/">More about me →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-process">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="home-section-heading compact">
          <div>
            <p class="home-section-kicker">How I work</p>
            <h2>Clear priorities. Useful work.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>
            No giant audit that disappears into a folder. The goal is to figure out what matters most and turn it into a practical plan.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="home-process-grid">
          <div class="home-process-step">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Find the opportunity</h3>
            <p>Understand the site, market, competition, search landscape, and where visibility is being lost.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="home-process-step">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Prioritize what matters</h3>
            <p>Separate high-impact work from the long list of things that are technically possible but not actually important.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="home-process-step">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Make it actionable</h3>
            <p>Turn strategy into clear recommendations, content plans, technical requirements, measurement, and next steps.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-final">
      <div class="container home-final-card">
        <div>
          <p class="home-section-kicker">Need help getting found?</p>
          <h2>Let’s figure out where the biggest opportunity is.</h2>
          <p>
            Tell me a little about your business, website, or search challenge. I can help you work out what is worth focusing on next.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a class="home-btn home-btn-primary" href="/contact/">Get a Visibility Review</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>